<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>VA Student Checklist</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .section-header {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  ul {
    list-style-type: disc;
    margin-left: 20px;
    padding-left: 0;
  }
  li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <p>Phone: {{ contact_phone }}</p>
    <p>Fax: {{ contact_fax }}</p>
    <p>E-mail: {{ contact_email }}</p>
    <p>Website: <a href="{{ contact_website }}">{{ contact_website }}</a></p>
  </div>
  <h1 style="text-align: center;">New VA Student Checklist</h1>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div class="section-header">Step 1: Apply for VA Education Benefits</div>
    <ul>
      <li>To apply for or activate your educational benefits go to <a href="{{ va_benefits_link }}">{{ va_benefits_link }}</a>.</li>
      <li>This site can also be used to transfer benefits to a dependent.</li>
      <li>Submit a copy of your Certificate of Eligibility to the UAF Department of Military and Veteran Services (DMVS).</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-header">Step 2: Apply for Admission to the University of Alaska Fairbanks</div>
    <ul>
      <li>You must be fully enrolled as a degree seeking student in order to receive your VA benefits.</li>
      <li>Apply for admission to the University of Alaska Fairbanks.</li>
      <li>Submit required transcripts for admissions to include your military transcripts found at <a href="{{ transcript_link }}">{{ transcript_link }}</a> for Air Force Veterans, and <a href="{{ jst_link }}">{{ jst_link }}</a> for the other branches of service.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-header">Step 3: Register for Your Classes</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Set up a time to speak with your advisor to register for all classes you are wanting to take that are required by your degree plan at <a href="{{ catalog_link }}">{{ catalog_link }}</a>.</li>
      <li>Only register for classes that are required by degree plan.</li>
      <li>A full time student for an Undergraduate degree is 12 credit hours for Fall and Spring Semesters. For a full Summer Semester here at UAF you will need 8 credit hours.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-header">Step 4: Submit Your Certification Request Form (CRF)</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Every semester you are REQUIRED to submit a CRF if you want the VA to pay for your classes.</li>
      <li>The CRF must be submitted no later than the first day of the class.</li>
      <li>Only classes that are REQUIRED for your degree plan and on Degree Works will be certified by the VA.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-header">Step 5: Adding or Dropping a Class</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Report course changes: adding, dropping, or withdrawal from a course, and application for graduation; to the DMVS on Certification Adjustment Form found at <a href="{{ adjustment_form_link }}">{{ adjustment_form_link }}</a>.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-header">Step 6: Paying your bill</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Chapter 31 and 33- must submit COE or CRF no later than the 1st day of class, to the UAF DMVS, to have deferred payment for tuition and fees.</li>
      <li>Once VA payment has been applied to the student account, you have 5 days to pay any tuition and fees not covered by the VA.</li>
      <li>Chapter 30 and 35- will follow student standard guidelines for payment and payment arrangements by the fee payment deadline.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-header">Step 7: Changes</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Report all changes: personal info, degree, university, and VA Education benefits to the DMVS on a VA Change Form.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-header">Step 8: Maximize all sources of funding</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Free Application for Federal Student Aid (FAFSA) at <a href="{{ fafsa_link }}">{{ fafsa_link }}</a> (recommended but not required)</li>
      <li>UAF Scholarships found at <a href="{{ uaf_scholarship_link }}">{{ uaf_scholarship_link }}</a> (recommended but not required)</li>
      <li>A source to research scholarships for students for both veterans and dependents is found at the Fisher House Scholarship finder found at <a href="{{ fisher_scholarship_link }}">{{ fisher_scholarship_link }}</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="section-header">Step 9: Check your UAF.edu email</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Important time sensitive information will only be sent to your UAF.edu email.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>